  "notes": "Dark pro-tool UI (Linear/Radix-like zinc greys) with a single amber #f5a524 accent marking the active mode, selected segment and primary CTAs (Play shot, Apply move, Drop camera mark). Character tracks are color-coded (MAYA red, DEX blue) and that color carries into the 3D viewport marks/paths. Icons are emoji glyphs in button labels. Film-language vocabulary throughout (WS/FS/MCU, 2-SHOT, OTS, DUTCH, Steadicam, Crane/Jib). DELIVER mode exports shot packages and writes a prompt for Seedance video generation. Inset 'Shot preview' picture-in-picture camera view floats in the viewport. Proposed new entry scene-editor-3d."
